        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Abnormal N-glycosylation pattern plus biallelic pathogenic DDOST variants",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is confirmed by molecular genetic testing combined with biochemical evidence of glycosylation defects."
